{"4110410": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Drift-تفحيط", "steam_appid": 4110410, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Drift – تفحيط</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drift – تفحيط</strong> is an immersive drifting and driving experience that blends realistic car control with a fun open-world playground. Customize, tune, and push your cars to the limit across a detailed city inspired by real-world streets.<br><br><br><strong>Garage &amp; Car Customization</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110410/extras/9c9cb2e20e28424419387901aef4cd1a.avif?t=1770032351\" width=1560 height=439 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your dream drift car in a fully featured garage. Personalize every detail to match your style:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Car paint &amp; window tint</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flags &amp; custom license plates</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wheel and rim customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Car lights and visual upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And much more</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your car, your identity.<br><br><br><strong>30+ Cars (More Coming Soon)</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110410/extras/1c0b2c84bfd2732fc7e12236f343e94d.avif?t=1770032351\" width=1560 height=439 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from <strong>over 30 unique cars</strong>, each with its own handling and personality. New vehicles are continuously added through updates, keeping the experience fresh and exciting.<br><br><strong>Advanced Tuning System</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110410/extras/88c9a59612b397801cf642b3fc750ffd.avif?t=1770032351\" width=1560 height=439 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every car can be fully adapted to your driving style.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple tuning options and performance upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fine-tune handling, balance, and responsiveness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Configure your car for drifting, high-speed racing, or smooth cruising</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master your setup and dominate the roads.<br><br><strong>Large Open-World Map</strong><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110410/extras/8f228429fe053b030922fe79c38ec305.avif?t=1770032351\" width=1560 height=439 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a <strong>large open-world city</strong> designed to simulate real streets, created by <strong>MohdTN</strong>.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wide highways</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gulf streets</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect roads for drifting and high-speed driving<br><br>🏁 <strong>Highway Racer Challenge</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110410/extras/5e0c46f39a8f119234748ce7ae2e7a70.avif?t=1770032351\" width=1560 height=439 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skills in the main challenge mode:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge traffic cars at high speed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive close to vehicles to earn more points</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect money and climb the score rankings</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only the best drivers survive the highway.<br><br><strong>Offline Open-World Mode</strong><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110410/extras/280c42d98db2b9fdb61a2775a623a5c6.avif?t=1770032351\" width=1560 height=439 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy full freedom with <strong>offline free drive mode</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive anywhere in the city</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore at your own pace</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice drifting or just relax and cruise</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No limits, no pressure—just pure driving fun.<br><br><strong>Roundabout Leaderboards</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110410/extras/9e4fa526f3c781d24f99f6c494fec074.avif?t=1770032351\" width=1560 height=439 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prove your skills in a unique competitive feature:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete full drift cycles around roundabouts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn scores and secure your place on the leaderboard</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Top 3 players</strong> get their names displayed on the roundabout</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6 different roundabouts</strong> to conquer</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leave your mark on the city.<br><br><br><strong>Online Multiplayer</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110410/extras/5ee686bac807629596d7e6352f73991a.avif?t=1770032351\" width=1560 height=439 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive together with friends and other players online:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join open sessions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cruise, drift, and explore together</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share the roads with real drivers</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun is better when shared.<br><br><br><strong>Racing Wheel &amp; Force Feedback Support</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience next-level realism with <strong>racing wheel support</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full force feedback</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhanced immersion</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive like a pro with realistic control and response<br> <br><strong>Drift – تفحيط</strong> is built for car lovers, drift fans, and anyone who enjoys freedom on the road.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your engine and show the city your skills.<br></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Drift – تفحيط</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drift – تفحيط</strong> is an immersive drifting and driving experience that blends realistic car control with a fun open-world playground. Customize, tune, and push your cars to the limit across a detailed city inspired by real-world streets.<br><br><br><strong>Garage &amp; Car Customization</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110410/extras/9c9cb2e20e28424419387901aef4cd1a.avif?t=1770032351\" width=1560 height=439 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your dream drift car in a fully featured garage. Personalize every detail to match your style:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Car paint &amp; window tint</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flags &amp; custom license plates</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wheel and rim customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Car lights and visual upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And much more</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your car, your identity.<br><br><br><strong>30+ Cars (More Coming Soon)</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=